# AI-Tester

AI-Tester is an automated testing framework for evaluating AI/LLM agents against structured question sets.

The project is designed to:
- Run batch tests against AI APIs
- Categorize questions (e.g. objective vs subjective)
- Capture, store, and compare model responses
- Support iterative evaluation during development (non-production)

This repository is currently focused on **local development and experimentation**.
